* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ico binary

# Git LFS: full-resolution generated concepts and game production binaries.
